**Document Scope:** Cross-vertical forensic and technical comparison of **Amazon Bedrock AgentCore** (specifically AgentCore Gateway, Cedar-backed AgentCore Policy, AgentCore Runtime isolated microVM sessions, and AgentCore Observability / Evaluations) against Spencer David Southern's **Mint-to Logic™** (`[100]`–`[600]`, April 15, 2025 drawings) and **The Shepherd's Method™ / Process** (December 19, 2024 filing baseline).

